{"id":"1105d909ac8fadce","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-supportcover.md","title":"Support selection as a set covering problem","display":"thm-supportcover — Support selection as a set covering problem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-supportcover","aliases":["27-thm-supportcover"],"display":"thm-supportcover — Support selection as a set covering problem","depends_on":["[[27-df-supportset]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§12.2.2 equations (12.5)–(12.7)","source_printed_pages":"516","source_pdf_pages":"540","verification_status":"source-statement-and-derivation-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-supportcover"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-supportcover</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-supportcover — Support selection as a set covering problem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"162ba4b092f14c5b\" href=\"?note=162ba4b092f14c5b\" title=\"27-df-supportset\">27-df-supportset</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§12.2.2 equations (12.5)–(12.7)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"516"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"540"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-derivation-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(T,F)\\in\\mathrm{pdBf}_n\">\\((T,F)\\in\\mathrm{pdBf}_n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq[n]\">\\(S\\subseteq[n]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\in\\mathbb B^n\">\\(y\\in\\mathbb B^n\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Support},\\mathrm{OptSupport}\">\\(\\mathrm{Support},\\mathrm{OptSupport}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"162ba4b092f14c5b\" href=\"?note=162ba4b092f14c5b\" title=\"27-df-supportset\">27-df-supportset</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"J(a,b)\\coloneqq\\{j\\in[n]\\mid a_j\\ne b_j\\}\\quad(a,b\\in\\mathbb B^n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[J(a,b)\\coloneqq\\{j\\in[n]\\mid a_j\\ne b_j\\}\\quad(a,b\\in\\mathbb B^n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"S\\in\\mathrm{Support}(T,F)\\quad\\leftrightarrow\\quad\\forall a\\in T\\;\\forall b\\in F\\;(S\\cap J(a,b)\\ne\\emptyset).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[S\\in\\mathrm{Support}(T,F)\\quad\\leftrightarrow\\quad\\forall a\\in T\\;\\forall b\\in F\\;(S\\cap J(a,b)\\ne\\emptyset).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\{j\\in[n]\\mid y_j=1\\}\\in\\mathrm{Support}(T,F)\\quad\\leftrightarrow\\quad\\forall a\\in T\\;\\forall b\\in F\\;\\left(\\sum_{j\\in J(a,b)}y_j\\geq1\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\{j\\in[n]\\mid y_j=1\\}\\in\\mathrm{Support}(T,F)\\quad\\leftrightarrow\\quad\\forall a\\in T\\;\\forall b\\in F\\;\\left(\\sum_{j\\in J(a,b)}y_j\\geq1\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OptSupport}(T,F)=\\underset{S\\subseteq[n],\\;\\forall a\\in T\\;\\forall b\\in F\\;(S\\cap J(a,b)\\ne\\emptyset)}{\\operatorname{argmin}}\\ |S|.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{OptSupport}(T,F)=\\underset{S\\subseteq[n],\\;\\forall a\\in T\\;\\forall b\\in F\\;(S\\cap J(a,b)\\ne\\emptyset)}{\\operatorname{argmin}}\\ |S|.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>两个投影不同当且仅当至少一个被选坐标不同，这给出 hitting-set / set-cover 约束 (12.7)。argmin 表示全部满足约束且目标最小的集合；可行性由原 pdBf 的不相交保证。空样本侧时约束为空，唯一最少支持是空集。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-supportset","status":"resolved","id":"162ba4b092f14c5b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-supportset]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-supportset","status":"resolved","id":"162ba4b092f14c5b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$(T,F)\\in\\mathrm{pdBf}_n$，$S\\subseteq[n]$，$y\\in\\mathbb B^n$；$\\mathrm{Support},\\mathrm{OptSupport}$ 见 [[27-df-supportset]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"(T,F)\\in\\mathrm{pdBf}_n","display":false},{"tex":"S\\subseteq[n]","display":false},{"tex":"y\\in\\mathbb B^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Support},\\mathrm{OptSupport}","display":false},{"tex":"J(a,b)\\coloneqq\\{j\\in[n]\\mid a_j\\ne b_j\\}\\quad(a,b\\in\\mathbb B^n).","display":true},{"tex":"S\\in\\mathrm{Support}(T,F)\\quad\\leftrightarrow\\quad\\forall a\\in T\\;\\forall b\\in F\\;(S\\cap J(a,b)\\ne\\emptyset).","display":true},{"tex":"\\{j\\in[n]\\mid y_j=1\\}\\in\\mathrm{Support}(T,F)\\quad\\leftrightarrow\\quad\\forall a\\in T\\;\\forall b\\in F\\;\\left(\\sum_{j\\in J(a,b)}y_j\\geq1\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{OptSupport}(T,F)=\\underset{S\\subseteq[n],\\;\\forall a\\in T\\;\\forall b\\in F\\;(S\\cap J(a,b)\\ne\\emptyset)}{\\operatorname{argmin}}\\ |S|.","display":true}],"bytes":1672,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-566","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-supportcover|thm-supportcover — Support selection as a set covering problem]]"}],"outgoing":["162ba4b092f14c5b"]}